		"Id": "chassisdef_shadowhawkiic_SHD-IIC-3",
		"Name": "Shadow Hawk IIC",
		"Details": "The Shadow Hawk IIC is an inexpensive second-line Clan BattleMech based upon the venerable Shadow Hawk design fielded by the Star League, although it weighs in at 45 tons instead of its progenitor's 55 tons. Introduced in the Clan's Golden Century, the Shadow Hawk IIC served with distinction for centuries to come in second-line and garrision clusters. The SHD-IIC-3 is a refit model from the 3060s using new technologies, featuring a 270-rated fusion engine and Endo-Steel and Ferro-Fibrous construction materials for weight saving. It puts the free tonnage towards an effective and distinctive loadout of a Heavy Large Laser, a Medium Pulse Laser, and two each ER Micro Lasers and Micro Pulse Lasers. 14 DHS cover heat needs and 6 jump jets provide extra lift.",
